  </p>
  
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">Individuals who rely on DeFi projects to store and maintain their savings are increasing day by day. Someone who knows about actuarial science leading </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">ADALend</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> is a rare asset, with a new set of skills bringing a unique flavour to the DeFi space.</span>
